# Cloudflare Pages — SPA fallback for the client-side router.
# Pages Functions (functions/api/edge/*) run before this rule, so the edge API
# is never swallowed by the fallback.
# Do NOT add a top-level 404.html: a custom 404 page disables Pages SPA mode
# and is served (with a 404) for unmatched paths, winning over this rewrite —
# every client-side route (/admin, /app, ...) would 404.
/*        /index.html    200
